 R←Test_Alias_013(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;filename;moved;rc;msg;res
⍝ Call ]Cider.OpenProject without an argument when no aliases are defined.
⍝ *** Note that this test temporarily moves the user's alias file away!
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 filename←##.Cider.GetCiderAliasFilename
 'Left-over from earlier test case?! Needs to be resolved!'Assert 0=⎕NEXISTS filename,'.bkp'
 :If moved←⎕NEXISTS filename
     (filename,'.bkp')⎕NMOVE filename
 :EndIf
 (rc msg res)←∆UCMD'OpenProject -watch=ns -batch -ignoreUserExec'  ⍝ ∆UCMD traps errors, so the file gets restored
 :If moved
     :If ⎕NEXISTS filename                 ⍝ In case the call created a new one
         ⎕NDELETE filename
     :EndIf
     filename ⎕NMOVE filename,'.bkp'
 :EndIf

 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠rc
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'There are no aliases defined'⍷res

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
⍝Done
